MimOffice
=========

MimOffice is a rebranded, actively-synced fork of the KDE Calligra Suite
(https://invent.kde.org/office/calligra, mirrored at
https://github.com/KDE/calligra), maintained by XI14 as the office-suite
sibling of the MimOS project (https://mimoslinux.org).

MimOffice tracks Calligra's stable release branches and periodically merges
upstream changes. Where MimOffice's source differs from upstream Calligra,
those differences are limited to: application/product naming and branding
strings, desktop entries and AppStream metadata, application icons and an
optional icon theme, and packaging/CI configuration. The underlying
application code is Calligra's, licensed as described below.

